msgctxt "92"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Oh... Hey, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Is there a problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "No, no. We're just talking about the second club. But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Kazuki-san won't listen to any of Yuya-san's ideas!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Is that true, Kazuki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Well, I wouldn't exactly put it like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about!? It's obvious you don't want Yuya-san to branch "
"out and do his own thing! Instead, all you're doing is keeping him on a "
"leash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I never said anything like that! It's just that... opening a new place "
"isn't as easy as you might think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"And we don't know a thing about Yokohama. Opening a club there would be way "
"too risky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"But if you don't take your chances while they're there, you'll never get to "
"the top! That's how business works!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "With your way of thinking, even the club you have now's gonna go under!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"That's enough of you running your mouth! What would either of you know "
"about running a host club anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "If you don't like doing things my way, there's the door!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"There he goes with that \"there's the door\" thing again! Let's get outta "
"here, Yuya-san. He can't expect us to work like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Yeah... I guess so..."
msgstr ""

